      "Do you prefer an elegant dinner in a fine restaurant, a sunset crab feast, or pizza and fries on the boardwalk? With over 100 different restaurants to choose from, Rehoboth Beach and Dewey Beach both offer a dining experience to satisfy every appetite and budget. , in addition to being ranked 40th for Southern Living's “Top 50 Beach Towns,” and voted one of the \"10 Best Coastal Small Towns in the USA\" by USA Today.",
